howl-report 2
profile el++
verdict inconclusive
termination fixpoint
rounds 2
inconsistent false
omitted 3
omission DataAxiom(<http://example.org/t#a> <http://example.org/t#u1> "1" .)
omission DataAxiom(<http://example.org/t#a> <http://example.org/t#u2> "2" .)
omission DisjointObjectProperties(http://example.org/t#u1 http://example.org/t#u2)
unsatisfiable 0
subsumptions 1
sub http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
exit 2
